spice
* SPICE Netlist for SRAM Cell
* PMOS Transistors
M1 4 3 V_DD V_DD PMOS L=1u W=10u ; Q8
M2 5 3 V_DD V_DD PMOS L=1u W=10u ; Q9

* NMOS Transistor
M3 3 Word_line 2 2 NMOS L=1u W=10u ; Q7

* NMOS Transistors in Cell
M4 1 6 2 2 NMOS L=1u W=10u ; Left NMOS in Cell
M5 2 6 2 2 NMOS L=1u W=10u ; Right NMOS in Cell

* Voltage Source
VDD V_DD 0 DC 1.8V